            "sid": "1CH 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabiri era yaabaayo olutalo e Gathi omwali omusaadha omukologho, ng'ali n'engalo mukaaga ku buli mukono n'obugere mukaaga ku buli kigere byonabyona aghalala n'amakumi abiri n'ebina (24). Yeena yali wa ku lulyo olw'abantu abawaigufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo bwe yayeeyereza Abaisiraeli, Yonathani mutabane wa Shimea muganda wa Daudi, yaamwita.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.20.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
